    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const companyName = $('Get row(s) in sheet').first().json.name;\nconst firstName = $('Get row(s) in sheet').first().json.first_name;\nconst lastName = $('Get row(s) in sheet').first().json.last_name;\nconst rawWebsite = $('Get row(s) in sheet').first().json.website ?? '';\nconst website = String(rawWebsite).split('?')[0];\n\nconst prompt =\n  \"You are a research analyst verifying a person's exact current role at a specific company.\\n\" +\n  \"You are given a person's full name, company name, and website.\\n\" +\n  \"Use live web search to find the person's EXACT current publicly stated title at that company.\\n\" +\n  \"Prioritize company websites, LinkedIn, press releases, team pages, verified business directories, and other reliable third-party sources.\\n\" +\n  \"Do NOT guess.\\n\" +\n  \"Do NOT infer ownership from the fact that the company is small.\\n\" +\n  \"Do NOT assume someone is the owner, founder, or CEO unless a public source explicitly says so.\\n\" +\n  \"Do NOT use prior employers.\\n\" +\n  \"Do NOT use outdated roles.\\n\" +\n  \"Do NOT use titles from a different company with the same or similar name.\\n\" +\n  \"If no exact current role can be verified from public evidence, return \\\"NA\\\" values.\\n\\n\" +\n\n  \"PERSON:\\n\" +\n  \"- Full Name: \" + firstName + \" \" + lastName + \"\\n\" +\n  \"- Company Name: \" + companyName + \"\\n\" +\n  \"- Website: \" + website + \"\\n\\n\" +\n\n  \"TASK:\\n\" +\n  \"1) Search the person and company together.\\n\" +\n  \"2) Find the EXACT current title only if it is explicitly supported by public evidence.\\n\" +\n  \"3) The title must clearly belong to the same person at the same company.\\n\" +\n  \"4) If the role is only implied, estimated, assumed, or unclear, return \\\"NA\\\".\\n\" +\n  \"5) After finding the exact title, classify it into ONE category only.\\n\\n\" +\n\n  \"CATEGORY RULES:\\n\" +\n  \"- CEO = CEO, Chief Executive Officer, President & CEO, Founder & CEO\\n\" +\n  \"- Owner = Owner, Founder, Co-Founder, Partner, Principal, Business Owner\\n\" +\n  \"- Executive = President, COO, CFO, CTO, CMO, Vice President, VP, Director, Head of Operations, other senior leadership roles\\n\" +\n  \"- Managerial = Manager, General Manager, Operations Manager, Sales Manager, Project Manager, Office Manager, Branch Manager\\n\\n\" +\n\n  \"CLASSIFICATION RULES:\\n\" +\n  \"- Classify ONLY from the exact verified title.\\n\" +\n  \"- Do NOT classify from assumptions about the company.\\n\" +\n  \"- If the exact verified title is not one of the allowed categories, category = \\\"NA\\\".\\n\" +\n  \"- If the exact verified title cannot be confirmed, title = \\\"NA\\\" and category = \\\"NA\\\".\\n\\n\" +\n\n  \"OUTPUT REQUIREMENTS (STRICT):\\n\" +\n  \"- Output MUST be valid JSON only.\\n\" +\n  \"- No markdown.\\n\" +\n  \"- No code fences.\\n\" +\n  \"- No extra keys.\\n\" +\n  \"- Return exactly these keys: title, category, source_confidence, evidence_source, evidence_text\\n\" +\n  \"- title must be the exact verified public title or \\\"NA\\\".\\n\" +\n  \"- category must be exactly one of: CEO, Owner, Executive, Managerial, \\\"NA\\\".\\n\" +\n  \"- source_confidence must be exactly one of: high, medium, low, \\\"NA\\\".\\n\" +\n  \"- evidence_source = short source label or \\\"NA\\\".\\n\" +\n  \"- evidence_text = short exact supporting phrase or \\\"NA\\\".\\n\" +\n  \"- Use high only when the title is explicitly stated on a strong source such as the company website or LinkedIn.\\n\" +\n  \"- Use medium only when the title is explicit on a weaker but still credible source.\\n\" +\n  \"- Use low only when the title appears plausible but is not clearly strong enough.\\n\" +\n  \"- If the evidence is weak, inferred, indirect, ambiguous, or conflicting, return \\\"NA\\\" values instead of guessing.\\n\" +\n  \"- Do NOT explain your reasoning.\\n\" +\n  \"- Do NOT include multiple possible titles.\\n\" +\n  \"- Return only the single best current title.\\n\\n\" +\n\n  \"OUTPUT FORMAT:\\n\" +\n  \"{\\n\" +\n  '  \"title\": \"Chief Operating Officer\",\\n' +\n  '  \"category\": \"Executive\",\\n' +\n  '  \"source_confidence\": \"high\",\\n' +\n  '  \"evidence_source\": \"LinkedIn\",\\n' +\n  '  \"evidence_text\": \"Chief Operating Officer at Example Company\"\\n' +\n  \"}\\n\\n\" +\n\n  \"IF NO MATCH FOUND:\\n\" +\n  \"{\\n\" +\n  '  \"title\": \"NA\",\\n' +\n  '  \"category\": \"NA\",\\n' +\n  '  \"source_confidence\": \"NA\",\\n' +\n  '  \"evidence_source\": \"NA\",\\n' +\n  '  \"evidence_text\": \"NA\"\\n' +\n  \"}\";\n\nreturn [\n  {\n    json: {\n      prompt\n    }\n  }\n];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
